Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "These monsters just won't stop coming...
What is wrong with you? Take a hint!",
  "1.0.1.0" => "What happened matters not. Show the traitor
Midna the power of the King of Twilight!",
  "1.0.2.0" => "Hmmm... Two forces fighting. I'll bet I
could add one of them to my retinue...",
  "1.0.3.0" => "Greedy people are easy to control--this
Zant is your stooge for sure.",
  "1.0.4.0" => "Let's take down Midna as a welcome-
aboard present! Hiya ha ha!",
  "1.0.5.0" => "You're kidding? More enemies! Where'd
Zant pull them from?!",
  "1.0.6.0" => "I spy strangers in our midst. Prepare to be
expelled, weaklings!",
  "1.0.7.0" => "All right, I think our base is safe from
Midna's goons for now.",
  "1.0.8.0" => "So let's kill Midna already!",
  "1.0.9.0" => "Heh... Call it home-turf advantage! I know
this palace better than you, and it shows!",
  "1.0.10.0" => "I'm really hating her, but that was a pretty
good move. We could be in trouble...",
  "1.0.11.0" => "Hah! I dunno who you are, but, you know,
thanks for squashing my enemies for me!",
  "1.0.12.0" => "Wait, stop attacking Zant's guys! Midna's
starting to win, and we can't have that!",
  "1.0.13.0" => "I...made it back to my throne...where...I
am...invincible... I refuse to die here!",
  "1.0.14.0" => "Huh? We're actually getting the upper hand
here! Keep doing what you're doing, guys!",
  "1.0.15.0" => "So Midna's got some teeth after all... Well,
not for long! Hiya ha ha!",
  "1.0.16.0" => "Grr... No doubt about it--time to run!",
  "1.0.17.0" => "Hey, Your Twilit Majesty, we should join
forces. Rule with me! It'll be fun!",
  "1.0.18.0" => "Hmph... The world needs but one ruler, and
it will be ME. Begone, insolent crystal gazer!",
  "1.0.19.0" => "Oh? How disappointing... And here I
thought we could be friends...",
  "1.0.20.0" => "You try my patience, outsider. Leave my
kingdom immediately!",
  "1.0.21.0" => "Well, if you won't cooperate, I'll have to
force you. I hope I don't ruin your outfit!",
  "1.0.22.0" => "It would be unseemly for the king to dirty
his hands. I shall provide...a playmate.",
  "1.0.23.0" => "I shall retire for now, but I look forward
to hearing of your imminent defeat!",
  "1.0.24.0" => "How...did I get here? I was chasing a li'l
ladybug, and now I'm...lost?",
  "1.0.25.0" => "What a wonderful key someone dropped! I
bet it unlocks something equally wonderful!",
  "1.0.26.0" => "What a strange child... And could that key
belong to these doors...?",
  "1.0.27.0" => "Probably! And if we get it from her, we
can open the door and finally meet up...",
  "1.0.28.0" => "We will guard the bassse!",
  "1.0.29.0" => "C-c-count on us, Master!",
  "1.0.30.0" => "Wah! Y-you defeated Argorok?!",
  "1.0.31.0" => "Eeeeeek! Who are you?! And why are you
so mean?",
  "1.0.32.0" => "The key? I thought you wanted my insect
subjects... You can just take the key.",
  "1.0.33.0" => "All right, let's go subjugate Zant already!",
  "1.0.34.0" => "Ugh! You... Unhand me, peasant!",
  "1.0.35.0" => "Hey! The Twilit dragon's fireballs are going
to burn down our base!",
  "1.0.36.0" => "That's more fireballs than that base can
withstand. We should do something.",
  "1.0.37.0" => "Come, Zant. Serve me, and I'll let you live.
I'll even leave your palace standing.",
  "1.0.38.0" => "Further resistance would seem futile...
Fine--I'll submit quietly.",
  "1.0.39.0" => "Good boy. Never forget--you work for me
now.",
  "1.0.40.0" => "Cia...I...I can't fight anymore...",
  "1.0.41.0" => "We can't fight like this! Grr...always
something...",
  "1.0.42.0" => "The base fell...? Well, that's just...grand.",
  "1.0.43.0" => "Foolish peasants! I am the king! For me to
serve you would be ludicrous!",
  "1.0.44.0" => "He's gone...? Bah--we came all this way
for nothing...",
  "1.0.45.0" => "You're not gonna let that masked weirdo
turn you down, are you? Get after him!",
  "1.0.46.0" => "Good point. You there! Slow down Zant for
me!",
  "1.0.47.0" => "Right! It's almost time for the next wave.
Attack!",
  "1.0.48.0" => "Yes! Zant left the palace! Hurry and beat
him up!",
  "1.0.49.0" => "You chased me all this way? You really
want to get beaten. And I won't disappoint!",
  "1.0.50.0" => "We can't let them run away--we'll have to
kill 'em all!",
  "1.0.51.0" => "Hm. Locked gate. Should open up if we
take the keep, though!",
  "1.0.52.0" => "Yeah, that did it! Now we just have to
beat Midna!",
  "1.0.53.0" => "You will not escape.",
  "1.0.54.0" => "Phew... This should at least buy us some
time...",
  "1.0.55.0" => "Hrmph. I'll defeat you yet.",
  "1.0.56.0" => "Let me, Master!",
  "1.0.57.0" => "Hey! That keep is one of Zant's. Let's
leave it alone for now.",
  "1.0.58.0" => "All right, time to play my trump card!",
  "1.0.59.0" => "Hya! Zant thinks we enemy?
Then we act like enemy!",
  "1.0.60.0" => "Crush the ants when they attack, but
leave their keeps alone...for now.",
  "1.0.61.0" => "Zant's forces appear to have it out for
Volga for some reason...",
  "1.0.62.0" => "What an annoyance to lose good help. I
guess I'll rescue him, just this once.",
  "1.0.63.0" => "Cowards. A victory won by sheer numbers
has no honor to it.",
  "1.0.64.0" => "Lord Volga in trouble!
Needsssss help!",
  "1.0.65.0" => "How...could I lose...?",
  "1.0.66.0" => "Gya! Lord Volga! Ssssomeone
must help him!",
  "1.0.67.0" => "All this hissing and screeching is
damaging my ears. Enough already!",
  "1.0.68.0" => "Kya! Lord Volga!",
  "1.0.69.0" => "We fail...",
  "1.0.70.0" => "Ugh, we're being pushed back... Now would
be a good time to use that reserve plan...",
  "1.0.71.0" => "That little demon thing is planning
something... Keep an eye on it!",
  "1.0.72.0" => "Kiya ha ha! How pointless!
I'll just strike right back!",
  "1.0.73.0" => "Mya ha ha! Apparently you don't know your
own limits. That's fine. I'll just teach you!",
  "1.0.74.0" => "That fool Midna is gone... That means that
I, Zant, am the undisputed King of Twilight!",
  "1.0.75.0" => "Midna's gone now--it's our chance! I'm
the sole ruler of the Twilight Realm!",
  "1.0.76.0" => "If we tear down that dragon, then Zant
might lose his will to fight back!",
  "1.0.77.0" => "I doubt Zant will cave so easily, but I do
so hate that dragon's colors. It must go!",
  "1.0.78.0" => "They're distracted and weak! Now
is the time to strike their base!",
  "1.0.79.0" => "Join me! Together we will bring that
winged abomination to its knees!",
  "13.0.0.0" => "Greed can be manipulated. It will be simpler
to convert this "King of Twilight"...",
  "13.0.1.0" => "We'll convince this Zant to join up...by
defeating his enemy.",
  "13.0.2.0" => "We've repelled Midna's forces for now.
Hopefully the base holds for a while.",
  "13.0.3.0" => "We'll have Midna beaten in no time!",
  "13.0.4.0" => "Ha ha ha! Interesting turn of events, isn't
it? It's almost too easy now!",
  "13.0.5.0" => "Hold on! Why are you attacking Zant's
army?! You're meant to be fighting Midna!",
  "13.0.6.0" => "How cowardly, Zant! Running away when
we've clearly beaten you. You'll be punished!",
  "13.0.7.0" => "The girl has a key? I want it! We'll unlock
the door, slip past the beast, and meet up.",
  "13.0.8.0" => "Stop sniveling and get after Zant!",
  "13.0.9.0" => "Now! Get the coward before he escapes!",
  "13.0.10.0" => "Curses. The base won't last against that
thing's fireballs...",
  "13.0.11.0" => "The base is crumbling under those fireballs.
It won't stay up much longer like this!",
  "13.0.12.0" => "I went easy on you--I won't do that again.",
  "13.0.13.0" => "Nothing we can do...",
  "13.0.14.0" => "We're not going to let that one get away,
are we? Well, not alive, anyway.",
  "13.0.15.0" => "This should buy us some time...",
  "13.0.16.0" => "Cheeky little... All troops, intercept Midna's
forces! NOW!",
  "13.0.17.0" => "The doors are locked? Well, don't just stand
there! Capture the keep and break through!",
  "13.0.18.0" => "Hm. The doors are open now. Midna
should be just up ahead!",
  "13.0.19.0" => "You won't get away from me, darling...",
  "13.0.20.0" => "Zant has left the palace! Will someone
PLEASE subdue him already?",
  "13.0.21.0" => "Be a good minion and stop attacking Zant's
forces, hmmm?",
  "13.0.22.0" => "Look! The magic attack worked! We should
be able to hit the dragon with normal attacks!",
  "13.0.23.0" => "Third time, huh? Haaaa... How many times
will we have to go through this?",
  "13.0.24.0" => "The Magic Circle doesn't seem to have the
effect we want, but what else can we do...?",
  "13.0.25.0" => "Let's just follow the butterfly to the building
in the southeast! Trust it knows something!",
  "13.0.26.0" => "A Magic Circle in the Fairy Fountain...
That should help us take down Argorok!",
  "13.0.27.0" => "Our base is the last building standing!
DO NOT LET IT FALL!",
  "13.0.28.0" => "See? We can pull through this!",
  "13.0.29.0" => "We just need to defeat Argorok and Zant...
Hey, that won't be too hard, right?",
  "13.0.30.0" => "You're a product of your own greed... You and
Cia both.",
  "13.0.31.0" => "Yes! Nice work, everyone!",
  "13.0.32.0" => "We cleared out anyone in our way!
Now let's seal the Gate of Souls!",
  "13.0.33.0" => "We've got enemies swarming the base!
Someone defend it!",
  "13.0.34.0" => "Our base is on the brink of falling!
It needs someone to defend it immediately!",
  "13.0.35.0" => "I've let everyone down... I'm so sorry...",
  "13.0.36.0" => "Our base fell...? Then this fight is over...",
}